      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Based on the team’s internal incident-response metrics, mean triage time dropped from 45–60 minutes to under 15 minutes, a 67–75 percent reduction.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-circle-k-accelerated-devops-incident-triage-to-under-15-minutes-with-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
